description = "[color=\"#2225d6\"]Slide In[/color] 3 venoms.[br]Then [color=\"#078c60\"]Slide Back[/color] 3 venoms.[br]The slid back venoms gain 1 [color=\"#8f1e0d\"]Strength[/color] and [color=\"#b32295\"]Charm[/color], and lose 1 [color=\"#069c10\"]Poison[/color]."
